    "created_at": "2019-09-06T21:55:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-06T21:55:44Z",
    "body": "As it turns out my testing method was poor. I ran a trace on starship and saw it hung during the git_status module and made the leap.\r\nThis is not a bug in starship however starship does trigger a bug in sshfs when scanning the directory?\r\nHere is the 10 year old bug: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/sshfs-fuse/+bug/159031\r\nI have a remote mounted sshfs directory in my home directory.\r\n\r\nI have now moved the sshfs mount elsewhere and now there are no more issues with the git module anymore.\r\n\r\nShould you wish to pursue the sshfs bug & starship I'd be happy to provide more details I'd assume there is little you could do however. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
