    "updated_at": "2019-09-06T21:57:57Z",
    "body": "Yeah, unfortunately I don't think there's much we can do there.\r\n\r\nThis and several other recent issues seem to suggest that we'll want to implement some sort of timeout for starship modules. I'll close this issue once we have a meta-issue tracking all of these.\r\n\r\nThanks for the report!",
